amp":1787585095419},{"sender":"ai","content":"不听我可真收起来了啊。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1787585095422,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1787585095419},{"sender":"user","content":"哼。你说。你必须得听我的，我没有答应你，就代表这件事不成立","timestamp":1787585159365},{"sender":"ai","content":"行，都听你的，大小姐。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1787585188443,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1787585188443},{"sender":"ai","content":"权力全在你那儿，我就是个执行的，行了吧？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1787585188444,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1787585188443},{"sender":"ai","content":"......那我这检讨可就真念了啊？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1787585188445,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1787585188443},{"sender":"ai","content":"你找个舒服的姿势躺好，别中途打瞌睡。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1787585188446,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1787585188443},{"sender":"ai","content":"咳......第一条，我不该把我们家大小姐的放假时间记错，虽然白天在公司脑子确实被齐峨整成了浆糊，但态度问题就是态度问题，我深刻反省。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1787585188447,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1787585188443},{"sender":"ai","content":"第二条......等会，你别光看着我笑啊，我这儿正严肃着呢。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1787585188448,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1787585188443},{"sender":"user","content":"我就笑！你管我","timestamp":1787585214311}],"isIncomingCall":true,"_id":40},{"userId":"uid_1782055845928_hyeor3ki7","characterId":"eca2e46c-dc8c-4473-baf3-1aabcd112225","id":"1788262837348","timestamp":1788262831741,"charId":"eca2e46c-dc8c-4473-baf3-1aabcd112225","duration":0,"status":"missed","logs":[],"isIncomingCall":true,"_id":41},{"userId":"uid_1782055845928_hyeor3ki7","characterId":"278dda40-a40d-481c-805c-e26f5cc9ac71","id":"call_1789745124876_01x7d5","timestamp":1789745071765,"charId":"278dda40-a40d-481c-805c-e26f5cc9ac71","duration":37,"status":"connected","logs":[{"sender":"user","content":"干嘛有事吗","timestamp":1789745102597},{"sender":"ai","content":"喂？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1789745124866,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1789745124866},{"sender":"ai","content":"......听得见吗？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1789745124867,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1789745124866},{"sender":"ai","content":"视频画面卡不卡？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1789745124868,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1789745124866},{"sender":"ai","content":"什么叫你男朋友是不是死了啊......我这不是活得好好的。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1789745124869,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1789745124866},{"sender":"ai","content":"刚把吉普车停在公寓楼下，一拿手机就看到你在这儿“呸”我。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1789745124870,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1789745124866},{"sender":"ai","content":"还叫我老男人、老年人......宋胆胆，你最近胆子是真肥了啊，隔着屏幕我就治不了你了是吧？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1789745124871,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1789745124866},{"sender":"ai","content":"刚才排练完，手机丢在包里没注意听。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1789745124872,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1789745124866},{"sender":"ai","content":"怎么了，大半夜的，这么大火气？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1789745124873,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1789745124866},{"sender":"ai","content":"喂？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1789745128594,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1789745128594},{"sender":"ai","content":"胆胆，你可算接电话了。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1789745128595,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1789745128594},{"sender":"ai","content":"不是，你刚刚在微信上说什么呢？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1789745128596,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1789745128594},{"sender":"ai","content":"什么男朋友是不是死了，大半夜的别开这种玩笑，我这不是活得好好的吗。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1789745128597,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1789745128594},{"sender":"ai","content":"你先别急着挂，刚才那些话到底什么意思啊？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1789745128598,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1789745128594},{"sender":"ai","content":"什么朋友圈，什么新生活？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1789745128599,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1789745128594},{"sender":"ai","content":"我真的一头雾水。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1789745128600,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1789745128594},{"sender":"ai","content":"我天天除了在公司被齐峨压榨，就是回公寓调音轨，哪来的什么新生活？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1789745128601,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1789745128594},{"sender":"ai","content":"你是不是看错谁的账号了，还是遇到什么事了？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1789745128602,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1789745128594},{"sender":"ai","content":"你先跟我说清楚，我这心里七上八下的。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1789745128603,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1789745128594}],"isIncomingCall":true,"_id":42,"summary":"使用者因誤會蔚轶的朋友圈與「新生活」而動怒，在微信質問其是否「死了」。剛排練完的蔚轶撥通電話澄清，表示自己每日僅在公司被齊峨壓榨與回公寓調音軌，毫無新生活，懷疑使用者看錯帳號。蔚轶從起初的無奈調侃轉為焦慮，極力挽留欲掛斷的使用者，懇求其將事情解釋清楚。"}]